<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lucent cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lucent cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schroder &amp; Co Inc said it downgraded Lucent Technologies Inc to &quot;perform in line&quot; from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Lucent gained 14/16 to 82-1/16.</p>
</text>
